<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/backend.css?v=<%= cssVer %>"><%- include('../partials/brand-icons') %>
<style>.grant-panel{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;max-width:880px;margin:20px 0;box-shadow:0 6px 24px #1e44380a}.grant-form{display:grid;gap:18px;max-width:620px}.grant-form label{display:grid;gap:8px;font-weight:600}.grant-form select{width:100%;height:42px;border:1px solid #d9e2dc;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;padding:0 12px;font:inherit}.grant-message{padding:12px 16px;background:#f4ecd9;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:20px}.grant-list{padding-left:20px;line-height:2}.grant-meta{color:#69776f;margin:12px 0 24px}.grant-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}</style></head><body class="teacher-body"><%- include('partials/sidebar') %><div class="teacher-main"><%- include('partials/header') %><main class="teacher-content"><div class="list-header"><h2>开通课程</h2><a href="/admin/users-manage" class="btn-table">返回用户管理</a></div>
<section class="grant-panel"><h3><%= student.real_name || student.name || '用户' %></h3><p class="grant-meta"><%= student.phone || '未绑定手机号' %> · 用户编号 <%= student.id %></p>
<% if(message){ %><p class="grant-message" role="status"><%= message %></p><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/admin/users-manage/<%= student.id %>/course-grants" class="grant-form"><input type="hidden" name="token" value="<%= token %>"><label>开通类型<select name="kind" id="grantKind"><option value="package">班课（课程包）</option><option value="course">单独课程</option></select></label><label>选择课程<select name="item_id" id="grantItem" required><option value="">请选择班课</option><% packages.forEach(p=>{ %><option value="<%= p.id %>"><%= p.title %></option><% }) %></select></label><p class="grant-meta">班课开通后可学习其中包含的课程。此操作不生成付款记录，重复开通不会重复报名。</p><div class="grant-actions"><button class="btn-primary--sm" type="submit">确认开通</button></div></form></section>
<section class="grant-panel"><h3>已开通班课</h3><% if(!ownedPackages.length){ %><p class="grant-meta">暂无</p><% }else{ %><ul class="grant-list"><% ownedPackages.forEach(p=>{ %><li><%= p.title %></li><% }) %></ul><% } %><h3>单独开通的课程</h3><% if(!ownedCourses.length){ %><p class="grant-meta">暂无</p><% }else{ %><ul class="grant-list"><% ownedCourses.forEach(p=>{ %><li><%= p.title %></li><% }) %></ul><% } %></section>
<template id="grantPackages"><option value="">请选择班课</option><% packages.forEach(p=>{ %><option value="<%= p.id %>"><%= p.title %></option><% }) %></template><template id="grantCourses"><option value="">请选择课程</option><% courses.forEach(p=>{ %><option value="<%= p.id %>"><%= p.title %></option><% }) %></template>
<script>document.getElementById('grantKind').addEventListener('change',function(){document.getElementById('grantItem').replaceChildren(document.getElementById(this.value==='package'?'grantPackages':'grantCourses').content.cloneNode(true));});</script></main></div></body></html>
